   "file": "Q00194_SevenSignsMammonsContract/32573-03.html",
   "quest": 194,
   "text": "Grandma Tess: Oh my--of course it is! Now sit down, won't you, and tell old Grandma what you've been up to. I thought all you kids were going fishing today? Couldn't you catch anything?",
   "header": "Grandma Tess",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"No Grandma! And I'm real hungry!\"",
